{"version":1,"content":"<p>加州總檢察長羅布·邦塔周四宣佈，已向晶片製造商英偉達發出調查傳票。此前有指控稱，英偉達前行政總裁兼聯合創始人黃仁勳與一名被懷疑為中國間諜的女子存在婚外情。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587226.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.212953+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:18:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"6399ab4bc8a2e276bfd3394a7b0776cf5db6717aac9d7181525226f6133b09b6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}